{"sections":[{"slug":"晶体景","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"晶体景"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">晶体景</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“晶体景”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定基概形</span> $S$, <span lang=\"zh\">理想</span> $I$, "},{"Local":{"url":"/除幂结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除幂结构</span>"}},{"Plain":" (divided power) $\\gamma$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $S_0=V(I)\\subset S$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $S_0$-<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义其晶体景</span> $\\mathrm{Crys}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">如下</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对象为开集</span> $U\\subset X$ <span lang=\"zh\">和其到</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个提升</span>,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">覆盖为</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">覆盖</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}